---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Print the report schema, render reports in other formats, diff them

Usage: rustman report [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  schema  Print the JSON Schema of rustman.report/v1
  render  Render a JSON report as json, junit, markdown, html or sarif
  diff    Compare two reports: new, fixed and unchanged findings, coverage and assertion changes
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
